<urn:atm:triage:finding/AW-READY-N6>
  a triage:Finding ;
  triage:findingId "AW-READY-N6" ;
  triage:title "Minor bundle: OnceLock warn-once test fragility, unchecked Instant subtraction panic risk, global-install test order dependency" ;
  triage:description "fenix reviewer-B (01M1S72R6GNBE5ZETPK6943JMX). (1) crates/atm-graft-python/src/tool_types.rs:294,305 FROM_AGENT_WARNING OnceLock; deprecated_from_agent_warns_once_and_matches_from asserts exactly one warning, breaks if any other test touches from_agent first -- fix via inject/reset test hook. (2) crates/atm-daemon-bootstrap/src/diagnostic_timeline.rs:542-545 ac7 does `Instant::now() - 61s`, which can panic on a fresh VM whose monotonic clock is younger than 61s -- use checked_sub or an injected now/offset. (3) crates/atm-observability/src/tracing_bridge.rs:565 ac7_second_global_install_is_rejected uses the real global install, safe only while no other test installs globally -- document/guard the ordering dependency. Bundled as one minor-severity record spanning AW1 (tracing_bridge, primary), AW2 (daemon-bootstrap diagnostic_timeline), and AW4 (graft-python tool_types)." ;
  triage:phaseId "phase-aw" ;
  triage:triageMode "initial_pass" ;
  triage:category "test-determinism" ;
  triage:severity "minor" ;
  triage:repeatable true ;
  triage:sweepScope "workspace" ;
  triage:status "open" ;
  triage:dispatchReady true ;
  triage:triagedAt "2026-09-05T16:54:15Z"^^xsd:dateTime ;
  triage:foundIn triage:AW1 ;
